<title>USA: TABLE - Farrel Corp Q2 net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Farrel Corp Q2 net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>ANSONIA, Conn. 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>FARREL CORP</p>
<p>				   Financial Highlights</p>
<p>						 Three Months Ended</p>
<p>					Jun 29, 1997	Jun 30, 1996</p>
<p> Net Sales			   $26,183,000	 $13,196,000</p>
<p> Net Profit/(Loss)		     870,000	( 1,170,000)</p>
<p> Net Profit/(Loss) Per Share	    0.15	     ( 0.20)</p>
<p>						  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>					Jun 29, 1997	Jun 30, 1996</p>
<p> Net Sales			    42,306,000	  31,061,000</p>
<p> Net Profit/(Loss)		     764,000	  ( 989,000)</p>
<p> Net Profit/(Loss) Per Share	    0.13	     ( 0.17)</p>
<p>NOTE: Farrel said its quarterly results typically are affected by the cyclical nature of its business, where short term fluctuations in order intake and shipments affect quarterly results of operations. These results are not necessarily indicative of the results that can be expected for the full fiscal year.</p>
</text>
